 parent and child</strong> continue execution <strong data-start=3D"230" da=
ta-end=3D"265">from the statement after fork()</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"267" data-end=3D"393">
<p data-start=3D"269" data-end=3D"393">The return values differ (0 in child=
, child PID in parent), but here they don=E2=80=99t matter because there ar=
e no <code data-start=3D"377" data-end=3D"381">if</code> conditions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"394" data-end=3D"484">
<p data-start=3D"396" data-end=3D"484">So every <code data-start=3D"405" da=
ta-end=3D"413">fork()</code> <strong data-start=3D"414" data-end=3D"425">do=
ubles</strong> the number of processes executing from that point forward.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
